{"event_type":"review","id":"3b9566094d6c199bf87f67a12b4c29557b8bde4d1eec81a623f9d8adea27bf6b","occurred_at":"2026-11-06T01:59:18Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b719f3ae583ed957a3be0e5acf8528b1808643c7e3dfb791000b1d32e9303fe9","sha256":"b719f3ae583ed957a3be0e5acf8528b1808643c7e3dfb791000b1d32e9303fe9"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b6b301c41865717339242b33afacd4031b3119bfdf93f4d8d9964b0449d8fb70","sha256":"b6b301c41865717339242b33afacd4031b3119bfdf93f4d8d9964b0449d8fb70"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ca38c8a5e63d7e85efbc8d97a5929386880d72cbebad4eed2175032cbce5eaf7","sha256":"ca38c8a5e63d7e85efbc8d97a5929386880d72cbebad4eed2175032cbce5eaf7"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c4ee8fe9eebb1b5bfe3e37e6587045916c690d47b7e290886c50a56090abbfd5","sha256":"c4ee8fe9eebb1b5bfe3e37e6587045916c690d47b7e290886c50a56090abbfd5"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b5d914131662b1b1ac6d9b892498dfd6700edc9f005216b5c779fb3121b2f266","sha256":"b5d914131662b1b1ac6d9b892498dfd6700edc9f005216b5c779fb3121b2f266"}],"attempt_id":"409571720b9b0a9b5181e7686764a074c0d059a6eb315ed5f80a53ba0c1eb31c:0:1","base":"03bdcc76090b112b921289885112c4c6debeeec0","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"ea0ef2bf1a919145e880477112bc246b99e3f717","body":"**Throw `DispatchError('config')` instead of a plain `Error`.**\n\nA request that sets `beforeRequest` on a role bound to `claude-code` or `acp` triggers this throw. A plain `Error` carries no structured class, so `errorClassOf` cannot map it to `'config'`.\n\nThe comment at Lines 264-270 and the `DriverFactory` contract (\"Throws, never falls back\") say pre-dispatch misconfiguration is a structured `DispatchError('config')`. `laneForRole` follows that rule. This branch does not.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-  if (request.beforeRequest !== undefined && lane !== 'ai-sdk')\n-    throw new Error('upload scanning requires the ai-sdk request gate');\n+  if (request.beforeRequest !== undefined && lane !== 'ai-sdk')\n+    throw new DispatchError(\n+      'config',\n+      `driver factory: upload scanning (beforeRequest) requires the 'ai-sdk' lane, but role '${request.role}' resolved to lane '${lane}'`,\n+    );\n```\n</details>","id":"4510af9c794ae822eae036df4a289abd6482cd46e7b94449cbc3d486946b075e","intervals":[],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Throw `DispatchError('config')` instead of a plain `Error`."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"ea0ef2bf1a919145e880477112bc246b99e3f717","body":"**Reap session-bound rejections**\n\nIn `src/driver/factory.ts:398`, a rejected run bypasses cleanup. For example, a Claude Code CLI manifest error can occur after the prompt is saved; its `SessionBoundError` carries the record ID, but the record remains even when session logging is off. Reap that ID for fresh runs, preserve resumed records, and rethrow the error if cleanup fails.","id":"1dca3a526c8f83bcc7c196c8f80ce90f19f31ec693128e8756aef130f1338272","intervals":[],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Reap session-bound rejections"}],"head":"6e222d7aaf77218eddfe11db3dc04467b302d0a7","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"1e937e8e5e3e312d4d77a1dd88a7e93c86911564","intervals":[[1,558]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"},{"blob":"ea0ef2bf1a919145e880477112bc246b99e3f717","intervals":[[1,516]],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts"},{"blob":"5170341c9c52de685ba1603d9151341693b53612","intervals":[[1,308]],"path":"src/driver/schema.ts"},{"blob":"7c19ace53824e9513e1d23b4018e972e9196809e","intervals":[[1,417]],"path":"src/driver/types.ts"}],"job_id":"409571720b9b0a9b5181e7686764a074c0d059a6eb315ed5f80a53ba0c1eb31c:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"1e937e8e5e3e312d4d77a1dd88a7e93c86911564","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/README.md","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"ea0ef2bf1a919145e880477112bc246b99e3f717","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/factory.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"5170341c9c52de685ba1603d9151341693b53612","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/schema.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"7c19ace53824e9513e1d23b4018e972e9196809e","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/types.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"3aee477168e1da8e2aa232a98e80747d98da8f26f54f2a27e0c62d13e349d4b1","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"1e937e8e5e3e312d4d77a1dd88a7e93c86911564","intervals":[[1,558]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"},{"blob":"ea0ef2bf1a919145e880477112bc246b99e3f717","intervals":[[1,516]],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts"},{"blob":"5170341c9c52de685ba1603d9151341693b53612","intervals":[[1,308]],"path":"src/driver/schema.ts"},{"blob":"7c19ace53824e9513e1d23b4018e972e9196809e","intervals":[[1,417]],"path":"src/driver/types.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"1e937e8e5e3e312d4d77a1dd88a7e93c86911564","intervals":[[1,558]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"},{"blob":"ea0ef2bf1a919145e880477112bc246b99e3f717","intervals":[[1,516]],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts"},{"blob":"5170341c9c52de685ba1603d9151341693b53612","intervals":[[1,308]],"path":"src/driver/schema.ts"},{"blob":"7c19ace53824e9513e1d23b4018e972e9196809e","intervals":[[1,417]],"path":"sr